14	    <title>Welcome | Modern Web Template</title>
15	    <style>
16	        :root {
17	            --primary-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
18	            --primary-color: #667eea;
19	            --text-color: #2c3e50;
20	            --bg-color: #f8f9fa;
21	            --focus-color: #667eea;
22	        }
23	
24	        html {
25	            scroll-behavior: smooth;
26	        }
27	
28	        * {
29	            margin: 0;
30	            padding: 0;
31	            box-sizing: border-box;
32	        }
33	
34	        body {
35	            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
36	            line-height: 1.6;
37	            background-color: var(--bg-color);
38	            color: var(--text-color);
39	        }
40	
41	        a:focus-visible,
42	        button:focus-visible {
43	            outline: 3px solid var(--focus-color);
44	            outline-offset: 2px;
45	        }
46	
47	        .skip-link {
48	            position: absolute;
49	            top: -40px;
50	            left: 0;
51	            background: #667eea;
52	            color: white;
53	            padding: 8px 16px;
54	            text-decoration: none;
55	            z-index: 100;
56	        }
57	
58	        .skip-link:focus-visible {
59	            top: 0;
60	        }
61	
62	        header {
63	            background: var(--primary-gradient);
64	            color: white;
65	            padding: 3rem 20px;
66	            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
67	        }
68	
69	        header h1 {
70	            max-width: 1200px;
71	            margin: 0 auto;
72	            font-size: 2.5rem;
73	            font-weight: 600;
74	        }
75	
76	        main {
77	            max-width: 1200px;
78	            margin: 0 auto;
79	            padding: 40px 20px;
80	        }
81	
82	        article {
83	            margin-bottom: 3rem;
84	        }
85	
86	        h2 {
87	            color: var(--primary-color);
88	            margin-bottom: 1rem;
89	            font-size: 1.8rem;
90	        }
91	
92	        p {
93	            margin-bottom: 1rem;
94	            font-size: 1.05rem;
95	            line-height: 1.8;
96	        }
97	
98	        .cta-button {
99	            display: inline-block;
100	            background: var(--primary-gradient);
101	            color: white;
102	            padding: 12px 32px;
103	            border: none;
104	            border-radius: 6px;
105	            font-size: 1rem;
106	            cursor: pointer;
107	            text-decoration: none;
108	            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
109	        }
110	
111	        .cta-button:hover {
112	            transform: translateY(-2px);
113	            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
114	        }
115	
116	        .cta-button:active {
117	            transform: translateY(0);
118	        }
119	
120	        .cta-button:focus-visible {
121	            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
122	        }
123	
124	        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
125	            html {
126	                scroll-behavior: auto;
127	            }
128	
129	            * {
130	                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
131	                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
132	                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
133	            }
134	        }
135	
136	        footer {
137	            background-color: #2c3e50;
138	            color: white;
139	            padding: 2rem 20px;
140	            text-align: center;
141	            margin-top: 3rem;
142	        }
143	
144	        footer p {
145	            margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
146	            font-size: 0.95rem;
147	            opacity: 0.8;
148	        }
149	
150	        footer a {
151	            color: #667eea;
152	            text-decoration: none;
153	        }
154	
155	        footer a:hover {
156	            text-decoration: underline;
157	        }
158	
159	        .feature-list {
160	            margin-left: 20px;
161	            margin-bottom: 1rem;
162	        }
163	
164	        .feature-list li {
165	            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
166	        }
167	
168	        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
169	            :root {
170	                --bg-color: #1a1a1a;
171	                --text-color: #e0e0e0;
172	            }
173	
174	            h2 {
175	                color: #a8b9ff;
176	            }
177	
178	            footer {
179	                background-color: #0d0d0d;
180	            }
181	
182	            footer a {
183	                color: #a8b9ff;
184	            }
185	
186	            .feature-list li {
187	                color: #c0c0c0;
188	            }
189	        }
190	
191	        @media (max-width: 768px) {
192	            header h1 {
193	                font-size: 2rem;
194	            }
195	
196	            h2 {
197	                font-size: 1.5rem;
198	            }
199	
200	            p {
201	                font-size: 1rem;
202	            }
203	        }
204	    </style>
205	</head>
206	<body>
207	    <a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>
208	
209	    <header>
210	        <h1>Welcome</h1>
211	    </header>
212	
213	    <main id="main-content">
214	        <article>
215	            <h2>Modern Web Template</h2>
216	            <p>This is an improved HTML template built with best practices for performance, accessibility, and maintainability.</p>
217	        </article>
218	
219	        <article>
220	            <h2>Key Features</h2>
221	            <p>
222	                This template includes semantic HTML elements, responsive design, modern CSS with gradients,
223	                proper meta tags for SEO, and accessibility considerations to create a solid foundation for any web project.
224	            </p>
225	            <ul class="feature-list">
226	                <li>Semantic HTML5 structure</li>
227	                <li>WCAG 2.1 accessibility compliance</li>
228	                <li>Mobile-first responsive design</li>
229	                <li>Keyboard navigation support</li>
230	                <li>Open Graph meta tags</li>
231	            </ul>
232	        </article>
233	
234	        <article>
235	            <h2>Get Started</h2>
236	            <p>
237	                Use this template as a foundation for your next project. It's clean, well-structured, and ready to be
238	                customized to meet your specific needs.
239	            </p>
240	            <button class="cta-button" aria-label="Learn more about the modern web template">Learn More</button>
241	        </article>
242	    </main>
243	
244	    <footer>
245	        <p>&copy; 2026 Modern Web Template. All rights reserved.</p>
246	        <p>
247	            <a href="#privacy">Privacy Policy</a> |
248	            <a href="#terms">Terms of Service</a>
249	        </p>
250	    </footer>
251	
252	    <script type="application/ld+json">
253	    {
254	        "@context": "https://schema.org",
255	        "@type": "WebSite",
256	        "name": "Modern Web Template",
257	        "description": "A modern, accessible website built with best practices"
258	    }
259	    </script>
260	</body>
261	</html>
